{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601870/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1769590283\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601870/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1769590283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601870/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1769590283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near future. A remote mountain region becomes the epicenter of a mysterious paranormal event. The anomaly distorts reality itself, shattering everything humanity thought it knew about the laws of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Governments manage to contain the disaster, but every scientific expedition sent into the zone vanishes without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are sent in as the final attempt to uncover the truth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert in this place, you\u2019ll never know whether the light is guiding you\u2026 or the darkness is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) An open-world game, fully explorable from the start till the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) The hero is not defenseless \u2013 there are skills upgrading and most advanced military tech to help you  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) The Zone itself is against you \u2013 you\u2019ll fight with spirits, monsters and something more frightening \u2013 the time itself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Travel to parallel worlds and face their Guardians</p>","back